Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/sirfragles/lg-magic

Package: lg-magic-dkms
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dkms
Description: LG Magic Remote MR20 airmouse driver (DKMS) and tools
 Linux kernel driver for the LG Magic Remote MR20 (Bluetooth 000f:3412):
 a relative mouse (airmouse) and a raw IMU evdev device, with per-device
 calibration loaded from firmware blobs.
 .
 Also ships the lg-magic userspace tools - a single C binary with the
 IMU reader, HID report analyzer, calibration utilities, configuration
 handling and the interactive `lg-magic setup` wizard that calibrates
 the remote end to end.
